ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡Vaya, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Qué casualidad,
me acabo de mudar aquí justo hoy.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}La última vez que visité el pueblo,
cuando vine de acampada,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} no tenía
nada claro lo de vivir aquí.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Pero tú me diste el empujón que
me hacía falta para decidirme,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Gracias!{{TAG:0003:0024:}} Eso sí, te recuerdo que ya
no hace falta que me empujes más.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0500}}(Por si te entra la tentación.){{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}

{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡Huy, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Me vendiste tan bien {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0006:}}
cuando hablé contigo el otro día,
que he decidido mudarme aquí.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Espero que ahora no te arrepientas.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}O sea,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} ya me he mudado, así que
no hay nada que hacer.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ojalá seamos buenos vecinos,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ehi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Sono io,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0005:0001:}}! Ti ricordi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Non dirmi che non mi riconosci?!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Mi hai invitato a trasferirmi qui{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
quando sono venuto in campeggio!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Non ci ho pensato due volte!
Ho fatto i bagagli e sono partito
alla volta di {{TAG:0005:0006:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Eh già...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} adesso vivo qui.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Vieni pure
a trovarmi quando vuoi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hé,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} C'est moi,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0001:}} !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}T'as quand même pas déjà oublié ?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
On s'est rencontrés à {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}, et
tu m'as proposé de venir habiter ici.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}D'où ma présence à {{TAG:0005:0006:}}
aujourd'hui, pour ne rien te cacher !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Enfin bref,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} hésite pas à venir me
voir dans ma villa aussi souvent que
tu le voudras,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}¡Cof, cof, cof!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Eres {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¿me equivoco?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Me dijiste que me mudara aquí
cuando estaba de acampada
y eso hice.
Lo malo es que, nada más mudarme,
pillé un resfriado de campeonato{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}¡Cof, cof, cof!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}No quiero que se te pegue nada,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
así que será mejor que charlemos
en otra ocasión.

{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hola,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} me llamo {{TAG:0005:0001:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Encantado,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Como salta a la vista, soy
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:001F:00CD}}. Lo digo
por si no te habías dado cuenta ya.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Estaba un día en {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}
y {{TAG:000E:0012:0D00040075006E00060075006E0061000000}} tal {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} me preguntó
si no me interesaría mudarme aquí.
No me lo pensé dos veces...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡y ese es el motivo por el que est{{TAG:000E:0012:0A0002006500020061000000}}
{{TAG:0005:001F:00CD}} vive hoy aquí!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Selam,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} benim adım {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Bir süre
önce{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0006:}}'de kamp yaparken{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
biri beni bu kasabada yaşamaya ikna
etmeye çalıştı.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ben de böylece buraya taşınmaya
karar verdim{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ama bil bakalım ne oldu? {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Meğer o kişi
artık burada yaşamıyormuş!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}İnsanın canını sıkıyor, değil mi?
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ama{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} taşınmasaydım{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} bunca yeni
arkadaşla tanışamazdım{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Belki de kaderdir! {{TAG:0003:0025:}}İstesem de istemesem de,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
artık {{TAG:0005:0006:}}'in bir parçasıyım!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Tanıştığımıza
sevindim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ich bin {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Als ich vor einer Weile in {{TAG:0005:0006:}}
campen war,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} hat mich jemand
überredet, hierherzuziehen.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Und jetzt, da ich das tatsächlich
gemacht habe{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}wohnt diese Person
gar nicht mehr in der Stadt!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Aber ich bin nicht mehr sauer.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Dann muss ich mir stattdessen eben
andere Freunde suchen.

TRANSLATION:
Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} demek hâlâ konuşmadığım birkaç
kişi varmış.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ben {{TAG:0005:0001:}}! Tanıştığımıza sevindim!
Bir süre önce{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}'i ziyaret ederken{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
biri beni buraya taşınmaya çağırdı{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ama ben taşındığımda o kişi artık
burada bile yaşamıyordu!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Gerçi bu eski mesele{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Yeter ki sen de kalkıp taşınmaya
karar verme,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
It's me,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}I was camping in town a while ago,
and a person named {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
tried to convince me to move.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}And for whatever reason,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} I agreed
and moved here not too long ago!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sorry for not saying hello sooner!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
I hope we can become good friends,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Selam,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Benim,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Bir süre önce kasabada
kamp yapıyordum;
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} diye biri beni taşınmaya
ikna etmeye çalıştı.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Nedendir bilmem,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} kabul ettim ve çok
geçmeden buraya taşındım!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Daha önce selam
vermediğim için kusura bakma!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Umarım iyi arkadaş oluruz,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}¡Cof, cof! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tú eres {{TAG:0005:0000:}},
¿me equivoco?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Te voy a contar cómo he venido
a parar al pueblo:{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} un buen día
me dio por venir de acampada{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}En esa ocasión conocí a {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
y fue {{TAG:000E:0005:0400E9006C00080065006C006C006100}} quien me convenció para
que me instalara aquí.
Lo peor de todo ha sido que,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
nada más llegar, he pillado un {{TAG:0003:0013:}}
resfriado de campeonato{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
No paro de toser{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} {{TAG:0003:0014:}}¡Cof, cof!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sería una pena que te lo pegara.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Mejor hablamos otro día por si
las moscas.

